{# =====================================================================
   Visio Sapiens — MOBILE HEADER (shared partial)
   Include:  {% raw %}{% include '_header_mobile.j2' %}{% endraw %}

   EN | The mobile header is NOT the tablet header made narrower. On a phone
   EN | three separate cards (title / weather / time) would each get a third
   EN | of the width and become unreadable, so everything collapses into ONE
   EN | card: icon + title + subtitle on the left, time + short date on the
   EN | right. Weather does not fit here and lives in its own row instead.
   FR | Le header mobile n'est PAS le header tablette retreci. Sur telephone,
   FR | trois cartes separees (titre / meteo / heure) prendraient chacune un
   FR | tiers de la largeur et deviendraient illisibles, donc tout se
   FR | rassemble dans UNE carte : icone + titre + sous-titre a gauche,
   FR | heure + date courte a droite. La meteo n'y tient pas et vit dans sa
   FR | propre ligne.

   EN | EXPECTED CONTEXT / FR | CONTEXTE ATTENDU
     house, page_title, page_subtitle, page_path, page_icon, locale_tag

   EN | The date uses Intl with the SHORT weekday and month, matching what
   EN | the hardcoded ['Dim','Lun',...] arrays used to produce — except it
   EN | now works in any language.
   FR | La date utilise Intl avec le jour et le mois COURTS, ce que
   FR | produisaient les tableaux ['Dim','Lun',...] codes en dur — sauf que
   FR | cela fonctionne desormais dans toutes les langues.
   ================================================================== #}
      - type: custom:button-card
        view_layout:
          grid-area: header
        entity: {{ house.time_entity }}
        show_name: false
        show_icon: false
        show_state: false
        show_label: true
        tap_action:
          action: navigate
          navigation_path: {{ page_path }}
        label: |
          [[[
            const LOCALE = '{{ locale_tag }}';
            const d = new Date();
            const time = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(LOCALE, {
              hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', hour12: false
            }).format(d);
            const date = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(LOCALE, {
              weekday: 'short', day: 'numeric', month: 'short'
            }).format(d);
            return `
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0;">
                  <ha-icon icon="{{ page_icon }}"
                    style="--mdc-icon-size:24px;color:var(--paper-item-icon-color, #00E5FF);flex:none;"></ha-icon>
                  <div style="min-width:0;">
                    <div style="font-family:Orbitron,sans-serif;font-size:17px;
                      letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--text-primary-color, #FFFFFF);line-height:1;
                      white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;">{{ page_title }}</div>
                    <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--secondary-text-color, #8FB6C9);letter-spacing:.5px;
                      margin-top:3px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;
                      text-overflow:ellipsis;">{{ page_subtitle }}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align:right;flex:none;padding-left:8px;">
                  <div style="font-family:Orbitron,sans-serif;font-size:20px;
                    color:var(--text-primary-color, #FFFFFF);line-height:1;">${time}</div>
                  <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--secondary-text-color, #8FB6C9);margin-top:3px;
                    text-transform:capitalize;">${date}</div>
                </div>
              </div>`;
          ]]]
        styles:
          card:
            - background: var(--card-background-color, rgba(16,27,39,0.85))
            - border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.28)
            - border-radius: var(--ha-card-border-radius, 18px)
            - box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.12)
            - padding: 14px 16px
          label:
            - width: 100%
